### Test Challenge Refresh Flow
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5001/fitness-engine-a3383/europe-central2

### 1. Seed some challenge templates (if not already done)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seedChallengeTemplates
x-admin-key: YUBSgYb1mdtSaUZlgvjnzvHIjFg3AZ4uo4tmMVD24/M=

### 2. Seed universal challenges (if not already done)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seedUniversalChallenges
x-admin-key: YUBSgYb1mdtSaUZlgvjnzvHIjFg3AZ4uo4tmMVD24/M=

### 3. Create a test user profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/completeUserProfile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-test-user-token

{
  "displayName": "TestUser",
  "level": "beginner",
  "equipment": ["dumbbells", "resistance-bands"],
  "goalsDescription": "Build strength and improve endurance"
}

### 4. Manually trigger the daily challenge refresh (for testing)
# This will refresh challenges for all users with completed profiles
POST {{baseUrl}}/triggerDailyChallengeRefresh
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Manually trigger user level up (for testing only)
# This endpoint allows forcing a user level up without checking points or position
# Useful for testing the promotion flow and verifying new level challenges
POST {{baseUrl}}/manualUserLevelUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "your-test-user-id",
  "newLevel": "intermediate" // can be: "beginner", "intermediate", "advanced"
}

### 6. Complete a challenge (callable function)
# This endpoint marks a challenge as completed and handles points/promotion
POST {{baseUrl}}/completeChallengeEndpoint
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-test-user-token

{
  "challengeId": "your-challenge-id",
  "userId": "your-test-user-id"
}

### 7. Resign from a challenge (callable function)
# This endpoint marks a challenge as uncompleted and applies a penalty
POST {{baseUrl}}/resignChallengeEndpoint
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-test-user-token

{
  "challengeId": "your-challenge-id",
  "userId": "your-test-user-id"
}
